            "content": "### Introduction to Artificial Intelligence\n\n- Artificial Intelligence (AI) is the ability of machines to perform tasks that normally require human intelligence.\n- These tasks include thinking, learning, reasoning, and decision-making.\n- AI systems try to mimic how humans solve problems.\n- It is one of the fastest-growing technologies in the world today.\n- AI is used in both simple and complex systems.\n\n> **Example:** When your phone suggests the next word while typing, it is using AI.\n\n---\n\n### Definition of AI\n\n- AI is a branch of computer science that focuses on building smart machines.\n- These machines can learn from data and improve over time.\n- AI systems do not need to be manually programmed for every task.\n- They can adapt based on experience.\n- AI combines programming, data, and algorithms.\n\n> **Example:** Chatbots that answer customer questions automatically.\n\n---\n\n### Core Capabilities of AI\n\n- Learning from data (Machine Learning).\n- Understanding human language (Natural Language Processing).\n- Recognizing images and faces.\n- Making predictions and decisions.\n- Improving performance over time.\n- Handling large amounts of data quickly.\n\n> **Example:** Face unlock in smartphones recognizes your face using AI.\n\n---\n\n### How AI Works\n\n- AI systems take input data from users or environment.\n- Algorithms process this data step by step.\n- The system finds patterns and relationships in data.\n- It then gives output such as prediction or decision.\n- AI improves with more data and training.\n- Feedback helps AI become more accurate.\n\n> **Example:** YouTube recommends videos based on your watch history.\n\n---\n\n### Examples of AI in Daily Life\n\n- Search engines show relevant results quickly.\n- Voice assistants respond to commands.\n- Recommendation systems suggest content.\n- Navigation apps find best routes.\n- Smart devices automate home tasks.\n- AI is used in social media feeds.\n\n> **Example:** Google Maps suggests the fastest route using traffic data.\n\n---\n\n### Importance of AI\n\n- Automates repetitive and boring tasks.\n- Reduces human effort and saves time.\n- Improves accuracy and reduces errors.\n- Helps businesses make better decisions.\n- Used in healthcare, education, and industry.\n- Drives innovation and future technologies.\n\n> **Example:** Hospitals use AI to detect diseases early from reports.",
