            "title": "TensorFlow",
            "duration": "15 mins",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "### Introduction to TensorFlow\n\n- TensorFlow is an open-source deep learning framework.\n- Developed by Google.\n- Used to build and train neural networks.\n- Supports large-scale machine learning models.\n- Works with both CPU and GPU.\n- Widely used in AI industry.\n\n> **Example:** Google Photos image recognition system.\n\n---\n\n### Why TensorFlow is Used\n\n- Easy model building tools.\n- Supports deep learning and ML.\n- High performance for large data.\n- Scalable for production systems.\n- Works with Python API.\n- Strong community support.\n\n> **Example:** Training a model to detect objects in images.\n\n---\n\n### Key Features of TensorFlow\n\n- Tensor-based computations.\n- Graph-based processing.\n- GPU acceleration support.\n- Pre-built neural network layers.\n- Model deployment tools.\n- Flexible architecture.\n\n> **Example:** Building a chatbot model.\n\n---\n\n### TensorFlow Workflow\n\n- Define model structure.\n- Prepare dataset.\n- Train model using data.\n- Evaluate performance.\n- Optimize parameters.\n- Deploy model.\n\n> **Example:** Predicting house prices using neural network.\n\n---\n\n### Advantages of TensorFlow\n\n- Scalable for big projects.\n- Works on multiple platforms.\n- Fast computation.\n- Production-ready framework.\n- Supports mobile and web AI.\n- Highly reliable.\n\n> **Example:** AI used in Google Translate.\n\n---\n\n### Real-Life Applications\n\n- Image recognition systems.\n- Speech recognition.\n- Self-driving cars.\n- Healthcare diagnosis.\n- Recommendation systems.\n- Language translation.\n\n> **Example:** Face recognition in smartphones.",
