    "id": "top-ai-3-3-2",
    "title": "Probability Basics",
    "duration": "18 mins",
    "type": "text",
    "content": "### Introduction to Probability\n\n- Probability measures chance of an event occurring.\n- Values range from 0 to 1.\n- 0 = impossible, 1 = certain.\n- Important in AI decision-making.\n- Used in uncertainty handling.\n- Core concept in statistics.\n\n> **Example:** Chance of rain today\n\n---\n\n### Basic Probability Formula\n\n- Probability = Favorable outcomes / Total outcomes.\n- Simple mathematical calculation.\n- Helps in predictions.\n- Used in games and AI.\n- Easy to understand.\n- Foundation of probability theory.\n\n> **Example:** Rolling a dice → P(6) = 1/6\n\n---\n\n### Types of Events\n\n- Certain event (always happens).\n- Impossible event (never happens).\n- Simple event (single outcome).\n- Compound event (multiple outcomes).\n- Each type has different probability.\n- Used in real systems.\n\n> **Example:** Getting heads in coin toss\n\n---\n\n### Probability in AI\n\n- AI uses probability for predictions.\n- Helps handle uncertainty.\n- Used in classification problems.\n- Improves decision-making.\n- Core part of machine learning.\n- Found in recommendation systems.\n\n> **Example:** Email spam detection probability\n\n---\n\n### Conditional Probability\n\n- Probability of event given another event.\n- Written as P(A\n\n---\n\n### B).\n\n- Used in advanced AI models.\n- Helps refine predictions.\n- Important in data science.\n- Used in Bayesian systems.\n\n> **Example:** Probability of rain given cloudy sky\n\n---\n\n### Real-Life Applications\n\n- Weather forecasting systems.\n- Risk analysis in banking.\n- AI recommendation engines.\n- Medical diagnosis prediction.\n- Game development randomness.\n- Fraud detection systems.\n\n> **Example:** Credit card fraud probability detection",
