    "id": "top-ai-6-1-2",
    "title": "Data Preparation",
    "duration": "15 mins",
    "type": "text",
    "content": "### Introduction to Data Preparation\n\n- Data preparation is cleaning and organizing data.\n- It makes data ready for ML models.\n- Includes cleaning, transformation, and formatting.\n- Very important preprocessing step.\n- Improves model performance.\n- Used in all AI systems.\n\n> **Example:** Removing missing values from dataset.\n\n---\n\n### Steps in Data Preparation\n\n- Data collection.\n- Data cleaning.\n- Data transformation.\n- Data normalization.\n- Feature selection.\n- Data splitting.\n\n> **Example:** Preparing student dataset for prediction model.\n\n---\n\n### Data Cleaning in Preparation\n\n- Remove duplicates.\n- Fix errors.\n- Handle missing values.\n- Standardize format.\n- Improve quality.\n- Ensure consistency.\n\n> **Example:** Correcting incorrect age entries.\n\n---\n\n### Feature Selection\n\n- Selecting important variables.\n- Removing irrelevant data.\n- Improves model performance.\n- Reduces complexity.\n- Speeds up training.\n- Used in ML pipelines.\n\n> **Example:** Selecting marks and attendance for prediction.\n\n---\n\n### Data Splitting\n\n- Split data into training and testing sets.\n- Common ratios: 80/20 or 70/30.\n- Ensures fair evaluation.\n- Prevents overfitting.\n- Used in all ML models.\n- Essential step.\n\n> **Example:** 80% training data, 20% testing data.\n\n---\n\n### Importance in AI\n\n- Better data = better model.\n- Reduces errors.\n- Improves accuracy.\n- Essential preprocessing step.\n- Saves time in training.\n- Critical for success.\n\n> **Example:** Clean dataset improves chatbot responses.",
