    "duration": "15 mins",
    "type": "text",
    "content": "### Introduction to Model Evaluation\n\n- Model evaluation checks performance of ML model.\n- Uses testing data.\n- Measures accuracy and errors.\n- Ensures model reliability.\n- Important final step.\n- Helps improve model.\n\n> **Example:** Testing if spam filter works correctly.\n\n---\n\n### Why Evaluation is Important\n\n- Ensures model accuracy.\n- Detects errors.\n- Prevents overfitting.\n- Measures performance.\n- Helps improve model.\n- Essential in AI systems.\n\n> **Example:** Checking prediction accuracy of exam results.\n\n---\n\n### Evaluation Metrics\n\n- Accuracy (correct predictions).\n- Precision (correct positive results).\n- Recall (coverage of positives).\n- F1-score (balance of metrics).\n- Error rate.\n- Used in ML models.\n\n> **Example:** 90% accuracy in classification model.\n\n---\n\n### Testing Process\n\n- Use unseen test data.\n- Compare predictions with actual values.\n- Calculate performance metrics.\n- Analyze errors.\n- Improve model if needed.\n- Final validation step.\n\n> **Example:** Testing chatbot with new questions.\n\n---\n\n### Improving Model Performance\n\n- Adjust parameters.\n- Use better data.\n- Try different algorithms.\n- Reduce overfitting.\n- Increase training data.\n- Optimize model.\n\n> **Example:** Improving spam filter accuracy.\n\n---\n\n### Real-Life Applications\n\n- Healthcare diagnosis accuracy check.\n- Fraud detection systems.\n- Recommendation system testing.\n- Self-driving car validation.\n- AI chatbot evaluation.\n- Business prediction models.\n\n> **Example:** Testing Google Maps traffic prediction accuracy.",
