    "id": "top-ai-9-1-1",
    "title": "Image Processing",
    "duration": "15 mins",
    "type": "text",
    "content": "### Introduction to Image Processing\n\n- Image processing is a part of Computer Vision.\n- It involves analyzing and manipulating images.\n- Helps computers understand visual data.\n- Converts images into usable information.\n- Used in AI and machine learning systems.\n- Important for visual intelligence.\n\n> **Example:** Enhancing a blurry photo to make it clear.\n\n---\n\n### How Image Processing Works\n\n- Input image is taken by system.\n- Image is converted into digital form.\n- Algorithms process image data.\n- Noise is removed or reduced.\n- Features are extracted.\n- Output is improved image or information.\n\n> **Example:** Face detection in mobile camera apps.\n\n---\n\n### Types of Image Processing\n\n- Analog image processing.\n- Digital image processing.\n- Low-level processing (enhancement).\n- Mid-level processing (segmentation).\n- High-level processing (object recognition).\n- Used in AI systems.\n\n> **Example:** Object detection in self-driving cars.\n\n---\n\n### Common Image Processing Tasks\n\n- Image enhancement.\n- Image restoration.\n- Edge detection.\n- Image segmentation.\n- Object recognition.\n- Feature extraction.\n\n> **Example:** Detecting edges in a scanned document.\n\n---\n\n### Importance in AI\n\n- Helps machines understand images.\n- Used in deep learning models.\n- Improves object recognition.\n- Essential for computer vision.\n- Used in automation systems.\n- Powers modern AI applications.\n\n> **Example:** AI detecting tumors in medical scans.\n\n---\n\n### Real-Life Applications\n\n- Facial recognition systems.\n- Medical imaging (X-rays, MRI).\n- Autonomous vehicles.\n- Security surveillance systems.\n- Robotics vision systems.\n- Photo editing apps.\n\n> **Example:** Unlocking phone using face recognition.",
