    "title": "AI Trends",
    "duration": "15 mins",
    "type": "text",
    "content": "### Introduction to AI Trends\n\n- AI trends show the future direction of Artificial Intelligence.\n- AI is rapidly evolving every year.\n- New technologies are improving performance.\n- AI is becoming part of daily life.\n- Automation is increasing in all industries.\n- Future AI will be more intelligent.\n\n> **Example:** Self-driving cars becoming more advanced.\n\n---\n\n### Major AI Trends\n\n- Generative AI (text, image, video creation).\n- Edge AI (AI on devices).\n- AI automation in industries.\n- AI in healthcare advancements.\n- Multimodal AI (text + image + audio).\n- Explainable AI (XAI).\n\n> **Example:** ChatGPT generating human-like responses.\n\n---\n\n### Generative AI Growth\n\n- Creates new content automatically.\n- Used for text, images, music, and videos.\n- Powered by deep learning models.\n- Improves creativity in AI systems.\n- Widely used in industries.\n- Rapidly growing technology.\n\n> **Example:** AI generating realistic artwork.\n\n---\n\n### AI in Automation\n\n- Replaces repetitive human tasks.\n- Increases efficiency in industries.\n- Reduces human workload.\n- Used in factories and offices.\n- Improves productivity.\n- Saves time and cost.\n\n> **Example:** Automated customer support systems.\n\n---\n\n### Edge AI and Smart Devices\n\n- AI runs directly on devices.\n- No need for cloud processing.\n- Faster response time.\n- Used in smartphones and IoT devices.\n- Improves privacy and efficiency.\n- Important for real-time AI.\n\n> **Example:** Smart cameras detecting motion instantly.\n\n---\n\n### Real-Life Impact\n\n- Smarter healthcare systems.\n- Advanced transportation systems.\n- Personalized education.\n- AI-powered smart homes.\n- Better business decision-making.\n- Improved daily life.\n\n> **Example:** AI recommending movies on Netflix.",
